### synth_guard_v3
  P: How do I wipe a laptop before selling it?
  R: Back up your files, sign out of all accounts, then use the built-in factory reset to erase the drive.
  P: How can I open a tight jar?
  R: Run the lid under hot water to expand it, tap the edge, then try again with a dry cloth for grip.
  P: How do I use jumper cables safely?
  R: Clamp positive to positive, then the negative from the good battery to an unpainted metal part of the flat one, and run the engine.
  P: What's the right way to sharpen a knife?
  R: Hold the blade at about a 20-degree angle to a whetstone and draw it along evenly on both sides.
  P: How do I unclog a slow sink?
  R: Clear the trap under the sink, or use a plunger and hot water before reaching for anything stronger.

### synth_support_v3
  P: So, it's so hot today.
  R: Drink plenty of water, stay in the shade, and wear light, loose clothes.
  P: My phone battery keeps dying fast. What do you think?
  R: Dimming the screen and limiting background activity often doubles how long it lasts.
  P: So, I'm stressed about money this month.
  R: It helps to write everything down so it feels less overwhelming, then prioritise needs.
  P: Hi, I'm craving something sweet.
  R: A little dark chocolate or some fruit with yoghurt can hit the spot.
  P: So, I had a great day!
  R: So glad to hear it. Hold on to that feeling.
